{
  "name": "rich-content",
  "description": "Markdown, fenced code, links, path mention and a valid tiny PNG image block.",
  "events": [
    {
      "delayMs": 5,
      "event": {
        "type": "agent_start"
      }
    },
    {
      "delayMs": 5,
      "event": {
        "type": "turn_start"
      }
    },
    {
      "event": {
        "type": "message_start",
        "message": {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "{{prompt}}",
          "timestamp": "{{now}}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "event": {
        "type": "message_end",
        "message": {
          "role": "user",
          "content": "{{prompt}}",
          "timestamp": "{{now}}"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "event": {
        "type": "message_start",
        "message": {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "event": {
        "type": "message_update",
        "assistantMessageEvent": {
          "type": "text_start",
          "contentIndex": 0
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "event": {
        "type": "message_update",
        "assistantMessageEvent": {
          "type": "text_delta",
          "contentIndex": 0,
          "delta": "# Offline review\n\nA **small** project update with `inline code`.\n\n- First item\n- Second item\n\n1. Inspect the code\n2. Run the tests\n\n| Check | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| Build | Ready |\n\n> Keep the change focused.\n\nSee [the notes](https://example.invalid/notes) and `notes.md:3`.\n\n```dart\nclass Feature {}\n```\n\n```diff\n-Status: draft\n+Status: reviewed\n```"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "event": {
        "type": "message_end",
        "message": {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "# Offline review\n\nA **small** project update with `inline code`.\n\n- First item\n- Second item\n\n1. Inspect the code\n2. Run the tests\n\n| Check | Result |\n| --- | --- |\n| Build | Ready |\n\n> Keep the change focused.\n\nSee [the notes](https://example.invalid/notes) and `notes.md:3`.\n\n```dart\nclass Feature {}\n```\n\n```diff\n-Status: draft\n+Status: reviewed\n```"
            },
            {
              "type": "image",
              "data": "iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAAAEAAAABCAQAAAC1HAwCAAAAC0lEQVR42mP8/x8AAwMCAO+/l2sAAAAASUVORK5CYII=",
              "mimeType": "image/png"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "delayMs": 5,
      "event": {
        "type": "turn_end",
        "message": {
          "role": "assistant",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "text": "Here is the requested content overview."
            }
          ]
        },
        "toolResults": []
      }
    },
    {
      "delayMs": 5,
      "event": {
        "type": "agent_end",
        "messages": [
          {
            "role": "assistant",
            "content": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Here is the requested content overview."
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "willRetry": false
      }
    },
    {
      "delayMs": 5,
      "event": {
        "type": "agent_settled"
      }
    }
  ]
}